 levels.\n💙 Experience better gameplay with our latest optimizations.\n\nBot Clash is a battle simulator game where you and your loyal Bots travel across the planets to fight for humanity's last hope!\n\n💥 Battle against different enemies including bosses!\n🤖 Collect and upgrade powerful Bots! \n🗺️ Discover new worlds and secrets! \n🏆 Climb various leaderboards and show who's the real boss!\n\n💎 Roblox Premium members receive 1OO% more Gems from battle!\n\n🤩 Major updates every Friday! \n⭐ Favorite & thumb up if you like the game! ","path":"/game/9300407930-new-bot-clash","slug":"9300407930-new-bot-clash","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/85c442e47514df0bb83f502344a1d9a4837ded52c520612c4e83d91916590627.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a32ca897728f56d19440707557bb4146/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":23,"visitor":212067220,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-05-18T18:40:18.074Z","creator":{"name":"Wild Explorers","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7182546997,"name":"[UPDATE 2.3] Attack On Titan: Vengeance","desc":"Welcome to Attack on Titan: Vengeance, a challenging and rewarding \n\nFight to reclaim the walls, explore the Giant Forest, defend fortresses against relentless waves of Titans, take on powerful Berserker Titans, climb the leaderboards, and team up with friends to restore peace to Paradis.\n\n⚔️ Designed to be challenging\nUnlike many Attack on Titan games, Vengeance is built around skill, teamwork, and progression. Titans are more dangerous, combat is less forgiving, and mastering your ODM Gear is essential.\n\n📱 Full Mobile, Xbox & PlayStation Support\n\n✨ 1.5x XP Every Weekend\n\n🎁 Next Code at 50,000 Likes!\n\n💬 Join our Discord server for the latest codes, updates, FAQs, and community events.\n\n👥 Official Group:\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/9723353/AOT-V-Attack-on-Titan-Vengeance\n\nTags: Attack on Titan, AOT, Shingeki no Kyojin, SNK, ODM Gear, Titans, Bosses, M